{
  "schema": "fieldwork/report-formats/1",
  "note": "THE DRAFT'S FORMATS, AS MAPPINGS ONTO ROLES (experiment 202, 2026-11-15). A role is what a section holds and where it comes from; a format is its own headings, in its own order, each pointing to roles. What the person writes is kept by role, so it follows them from one format to another. Each format names the published reports it follows, read at their sources (workspace reports/Sit rep and surveillance report templates.md). The publication is laid out by its own code and is not declared here. Each target's outline lists its slots: a role, the heading the slot takes there and the length it wants; a notes role matches notes by section and function.",
